<title>ITALY: Gross yield set at 5.92 pct at new 18-mo CTZ sale.</title>
<headline>Gross yield set at 5.92 pct at new 18-mo CTZ sale.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result for the 2.0 trillion lire auction of a new first tranche of July 15, 1998, 18-month Italian Treasury zero coupon certificates (CTZ).</p>
<p>			   July 15, 1998</p>
<p>Net Yield		  5.19 pct</p>
<p>Gross Yield		5.92 pct</p>
<p>Assigned price	  91.75</p>
<p>Bids			4.758 trillion lire</p>
<p>Assigned		  2.000 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - The Treasury has said that tranches of the new 18-month CTZ, making its debut on Friday, will be issued alongside regular issues of the existing 2-year CTZ.</p>
</text>
